 "description": "Made of aluminum like the most luxurious superyachts and vessels, this gem of naval architecture has the ultimate performance, durability, and safety for recreational yachting for true ocean explorers. Your adventures become limitless with the EXPLR 44: explore the world from ice-covered seas of Scandinavia to the oceans of the Atlantic and Pacific, while enjoying the comfort of your luxurious adventure home.\nSmooth ride even in the roughest conditions. The outboard options range from 700 hp to 1350 hp, bringing the ultimate driving experience into your reach.\nThe fuel capacity of EXPLR 44 offers a great range from places like Miami to the Bahamas, or from the French Riviera to Corsica with a good margin.\nWith XO EXPLR 44, our mission is to bring the premium material and naval architecture to adventure yachting. At 44 feet, the EXPLR really benefits from the rigidity attainable by aluminum with sturdy 8mm stringers at the bottom and a 5mm hull. Vibrations and shatters from rough seas just vanish and the solid seaworthiness can be felt at the wheel of this ultimate exploration yacht. In the long run, you’ll benefit from XO’s durability, resistance to corrosion, repairability and care-free ownership.\nThe cabins are all about Nordic style, luxury and comfort.\nUp front you’ll enjoy everything you’d expect from an owner cabin of an exploration yacht: a large double bed, head, shower compartment and good headroom with ample light, space for changing and stylish, yet practical detailing.\nThe aft. cabin has the option of a comfortable atrium, two single beds or a large double with its own head. Together with the additional bunk in the pilothouse, the EXPLR 44 comfortably accommodates up to 6 people. Even with all beds in use, there’s free access in and out of all the cabins. Another thing that separates the 44 EXPLR from others, is its cleverly designed large rear-facing windows, which make the aft cabin a pleasant lounge for privacy and comfort.",
 "credits": [],
 "awards": [],
 "sections": [
  {
   "kind": "block",
   "id": null,
   "title": "It’s all about travel, and the upcoming XO EXPLR 44 is here for it.",
   "intro": "Embracing all the benefits of an all-aluminum hull & superstructures and finding new ways to create the ultimate, yet compact adventure yacht has resulted in a strikingly modern styling —form following function. While classy and elegant, XO EXPLR 44 maintains its safety and high seafaring standards for reaching the edge of the world.\nProviding an inviting shelter or an open-air ambiance whether you’re heading for warm or cold, EXPLR 44’s air conditioning and heating ensure the comfort. There is space for solar panels on the roof, along with rails for roof racks to accommodate your bikes and sport gear. Sunbeds in the bow and aft transform into perfect lounging areas, when you want to relax and enjoy a cocktail after exploration.",
